---
import Site from '@/layouts/site.astro';
import { homeUrl } from '@/lib/urls';
---
<Site title="找不到这张作品 · 光影集">
  <main class="shell py-20 sm:py-28 flex items-center justify-center">
    <div class="card-surface max-w-md w-full p-8 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-border bg-secondary px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-muted-foreground mb-4">
        404 · NOT FOUND
      </span>
      <h1 class="m-0 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground">
        找不到这张作品或周刊
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 mb-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        该作品链接可能已失效，或尚未收录至当前摄影周刊归档中。
      </p>
      <a class="control primary px-5 min-h-9" href={homeUrl}>
        浏览最新一期作品
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Site>
